      "standardized_narrative": "For the 2021 financial year, Syndicate 2121 experienced a gross prior year reserve release of GBP 10.6 million, calculated from the claims development triangle. This contrasts with the net improvement of GBP 5.0 million reported in the movement note, which also detailed various line of business movements. The prior year development was influenced by adverse court rulings and legal developments related to COVID-19 business interruption claims affecting the 2018 and 2019 years of account, leading to a declared loss for the 2018 year of account and the 2019 year of account remaining open with a forecast loss. The 2020 year of account also showed disappointing development against initial expectations.",
      "raw_causal_phrases": [
        "An overall improvement of GBP 5.0 million on prior years' provisions was experienced during the year.",
        "Improvements of GBP 0.9 million on motor, GBP 16.9 million on fire and other damage to property and GBP 2.2 million on pecuniary loss",
